=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Three Ideas for BioTech Products

@body

- Come up with three ideas for biotech products.
- Think about the sectors and consumers of the products
- Most important of all follow your own personal interests
- Submit to Google Forms.
  - You can adapt some of the previous years' ideas
  - At least one novel idea not listed on following pages.

@notes

Archived source slide retained from Lecture 04.
Historical dates or examples on this hidden slide are not current instructions.

=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Three Ideas Not in Modern Biotechnology

@body

- Health-monitoring glasses: sensors and hardware, not a biological production method.
- Smart health watch: device engineering and data analysis.
- Antibiotic bandage: drug delivery and materials engineering.
- Irish moss extract for limb regeneration: a natural remedy with speculative claims.
- A redesign could use engineered cells to make a specific biological product.

@notes

Archived examples from Lecture 04.
Apply the course-fit criteria to the specific proposal, not just its category label.

