=== layout: one-panel
hidden: true

# Tips for a Good Presentation

@body

- Tell a story with a beginning, middle, and end.
- Respect the four-minute limit.
- Explain terms at the level of the class.
- Engage the audience; use pictures and short phrases.
- Use notes if needed, and explain any video in your own voice.
- Prepare for questions and show enthusiasm.

@notes

